      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mekoryuk%2C_Alaska"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1934, 34 musk‑ox from Greenland were transferred to Nunivak Island to prevent the species’ extinction.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
